@@@ note
A footnote body hangs under its '[^label]: ' marker, indented to the marker width.

@@@ input
Some claim.[^note]

[^note]: The supporting detail, written out at enough length that it wraps.

@@@ wrap 80
Some claim.[^note]

[^note]: The supporting detail, written out at enough length that it wraps.

@@@ wrap 30
Some claim.[^note]

[^note]: The supporting
         detail, written out
         at enough length that
         it wraps.

@@@ unwrap
Some claim.[^note]

[^note]: The supporting detail, written out at enough length that it wraps.
